  "notes": "Canonical songs and releases remain separate from recommendation and live-performance discovery. Exact track mappings override deterministic verified performance-chapter routes, which override verified release fallbacks. v0.21.0 preserves Wave C, Playback Wave E, Wave D, Wave F and all current route-truth hardening, then extends issue #152 with 41 additional canonical tracks: Geeta Rabari's 28-track Zankaar 3.0 and Kirtidan Gadhvi's 13-track Tahukar 10. Thirty-nine exact official YouTube chapter routes are pinned only where titles and published timestamps are unambiguous. Zankaar 3 split-provider track 11 conflicts with the official chapter title and track 12 has a malformed published timestamp, so those two songs remain on conservative provider fallback. Tahukar 10 uses all 13 chapter starts published by Kirtidan Gadhvi Official. Continuous non-stop masters remain distinct from split-track catalogue editions."
